# Changelog - Diamond Cavecraft

All notable changes to the **Diamond Cavecraft** project will be documented in this file.

## [1.1.11] - 2026-05-26 [ACHIEVEMENT-MEMORY]
- **ONE-TIME ACHIEVEMENT MEMORY**:
  - Updated Sword, Pickaxe, Bone, and Void Curator achievement triggers so each unlock effect runs only once.
  - Repeated clicks or repeated unlock actions now open the saved in-depth achievement record instead of replaying the first unlock sequence.
  - Preserved `.dcc_eggs` persistence so unlocked achievements remain saved after restarting the software.
- **ACHIEVEMENT RECORD UI**:
  - Added an **OPEN RECORD** action on unlocked achievement cards.
  - Added saved record detail windows with the strange question, unlock logic, connection chain, and saved-memory explanation.
- **PRESERVATION CHECK**:
  - Preserved Registry, Visual Shaders, Color Lab, export behavior, KubeJS output, texture generation, and all existing achievement/easter egg identities from v1.1.10.

## [1.1.10] - 2026-05-26 [SWORD-REPAIR-EGG]
- **SWORD REPAIR EASTER EGG**:
  - Added the **SWORD REBOOT QUESTION** achievement.
  - Clicking the Sword preview now temporarily defeats the interface with a dark repair overlay, then repairs the UI back through a visible progress bar.
  - Added a unique Sword achievement window after the repair completes, with buttons to view Achievements or return to the working interface.
- **ACHIEVEMENT TAB EXPANSION**:
  - Expanded the Achievements tab from 3 to 4 tracked achievements.
  - Added saved `sword_repair` egg state to `.dcc_eggs` without changing the existing mining, bone, glitch, or void curator tokens.
- **PRESERVATION CHECK**:
  - Preserved Registry, Visual Shaders, Color Lab, export behavior, KubeJS output, texture generation, and all previous easter egg triggers from v1.1.9.

## [1.1.9] - 2026-05-26 [ACHIEVEMENT-QUESTIONS]
- **ACHIEVEMENTS TAB**:
  - Added a new **ACHIEVEMENTS** tab beside Registry, Visual Shaders, and Color Lab.
  - Added three achievement cards with strange-question hints, exact unlock logic, saved unlock status, and visible connection chains.
  - Added a real **REFRESH STATUS** button that updates the achievement cards from the current easter egg state.
- **EASTER EGG PRESENTATION UPGRADE**:
  - Improved the Pickaxe mining easter egg with a unique Deep Mining Question unlock window while preserving the original browser-link trigger.
  - Improved the Bone easter egg with a unique Bone Protocol Question unlock window while preserving the existing glitch/game-over trigger.
  - Added saved **VOID CURATOR** achievement state so the all-empty registry egg remains visible in the achievement list after unlock.
- **PRESERVATION CHECK**:
  - Preserved all registry items, Color Lab controls, Visual Shader toggles, visualizer cards, export logic, KubeJS output, texture loading, and previous easter egg triggers from v1.1.8.

## [1.1.8] - 2026-05-26 [PHANTOM-ACHIEVEMENT]
- **EMPTY REGISTRY EASTER EGG UPGRADE**:
