## [1.1.7] - 2026-05-26 [REGISTRY-COLOR-SYNC]
- **REGISTRY LIST REPAIR**:
  - Added Nether Wart, Blaze Powder, and Ghast Tear to the visible REGISTRY tab Resources list so the three existing preview/export items are also selectable and visible in the registry list.
- **DIRT BLOCK COLOR SYNC**:
  - Connected Dirt Block tinting to the same Block color control, so dirt-style block textures synchronize with the chosen block color instead of drifting into the wood/fantasia tint path.
